      <div class="mem-card">
        <div class="mem-card-badge-top mem-badge-paid">PAID</div>
        <div class="mem-card-label">Tier 1</div>
        <h3 class="mem-card-title">Insider</h3>
        <div class="mem-card-positioning">Where the work compounds. Live access, member pricing, deeper protocol content.</div>
        <div class="mem-card-price mem-price-pending">Insider pricing finalizing.<br/><span>Subscribe and we'll honor the early-member rate.</span></div>
        <ul class="mem-card-list">
          <li>Live Insider sessions with Dr. TJ — monthly group calls, real protocol Q&amp;A</li>
          <li>10% member-only pricing on Rx and supplements — compounding savings as the protocol deepens</li>
          <li>10% member pricing on environmental products — air, water, light, field exposure</li>
          <li>Access to Month 5+ advanced protocol content — deeper education as the work deepens</li>
          <li>Private Insider community — accountability circle, not a feed</li>
          <li>Session recordings — catch every call even when life intervenes</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mem-notify">
          <p class="mem-notify-label">Notify me when Insider opens</p>
          <EmailCapture source="membership-insider-notify" buttonLabel="Notify Me" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Insider Plus -->
      <div class="mem-card mem-card-plus">
        <div class="mem-card-badge-top mem-badge-paid">PAID</div>
        <div class="mem-card-label">Tier 2</div>
        <h3 class="mem-card-title">Insider Plus</h3>
        <div class="mem-card-positioning">Insider + a tighter cohort. More direct Q&amp;A, bonus protocol drops, higher discount.</div>
