        <ul class="mem-card-list">
          <li>Everything in Insider — all sessions, recordings, community, Month 5+ content</li>
          <li>Small-group cohort coaching — tighter group, more time, more direct feedback</li>
          <li>Bi-monthly live sessions with Dr. TJ — double the touchpoints of base Insider</li>
          <li>15% member pricing on Rx, supplements, and environmental products</li>
          <li>Bonus protocol drops — new science integrated as it lands, not on a quarterly schedule</li>
          <li>More direct Q&amp;A access — your questions answered, not just queued</li>
        </ul>
        <div class="mem-notify">
          <p class="mem-notify-label">Notify me when Insider Plus opens</p>
          <EmailCapture source="membership-plus-notify" buttonLabel="Notify Me" />
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Insider Concierge -->
      <div class="mem-card mem-card-concierge">
        <div class="mem-card-badge top-badge">Top Tier</div>
        <div class="mem-card-badge-top mem-badge-paid">PAID · LIMITED</div>
        <div class="mem-card-label">Tier 3</div>
        <h3 class="mem-card-title">Insider Concierge</h3>
        <div class="mem-card-positioning">Personal protocol design, 1:1 access, priority scheduling, full lab review. Founder Circle — limited slots.</div>
        <div class="mem-card-price mem-price-pending">Insider Concierge pricing finalizing.<br/><span>Subscribe and we'll honor the early-member rate.</span></div>
        <ul class="mem-card-list">
          <li>Everything in Insider Plus — all sessions, recordings, cohort, bonus drops</li>
          <li>Weekly live sessions with Dr. TJ — highest-frequency access available</li>
          <li>Personal protocol design with Dr. TJ — built around your audit, labs, and goals</li>
          <li>Direct messaging access — reach Dr. TJ between sessions, not just during them</li>
          <li>Priority consult booking — first access to open calendar slots</li>
          <li>Full annual lab panel review — comprehensive biomarker assessment integrated into your protocol</li>
