      <div class="mem-card mem-card-graduate">
        <div class="mem-card-badge-top mem-badge-earned">EARNED</div>
        <div class="mem-card-label">Earned Status</div>
        <h3 class="mem-card-title">Graduate</h3>
        <div class="mem-card-positioning">Earned through 12+ months of continuous Insider participation and 4M milestones. Permanent. Cannot be purchased.</div>
        <div class="mem-card-price mem-price-earned">Lifetime member pricing<br/><span>No recurring cost once earned</span></div>
        <ul class="mem-card-list">
          <li>12+ months continuous Insider participation — the work, not just the subscription</li>
          <li>4M program milestone completion — criteria formalized as the cohort matures</li>
          <li>Lifetime member pricing on all protocol products — permanent, no renewal required</li>
          <li>Permanent Graduate designation — the only status that cannot be bought back once lost</li>
          <li>Phase 2 sharing program — priority access when the wellness mutual-aid vehicle launches</li>
          <li>Gateway status — first look at future program vehicles, partnerships, and offers</li>
        </ul>
        <a href="#graduate-faq-how" class="btn btn-outline-golden mem-cta">How to earn Graduate status <i class="fas fa-chevron-down"></i></a>
      </div>

    </div>
  </div>
</section>

