        <p>Your free Protégé tier doesn't expire. If Insider doesn't earn its place in your life, stay free forever. I'd rather you run the protocol at zero than abandon it at any price.</p>
        <div class="why-attr">— Dr. TJ</div>
      </div>
      <div class="why-card">
        <div class="why-quote-mark">"</div>
        <p>Graduate is the only status I can't sell — only earn. That's the point. The program is designed so that earning it is the proof it worked.</p>
